 ; ============================================================================
-; DR FORTRESS AI V13 FIX21
+; DR FORTRESS AI V13 FIX22
+; FIX22 unified attack owner / real ally rescue / peace-pressure / elite guarantee:
+; - makes the final Fortress layer the sole writer of createarmy, sn-number-attack-groups, sn-percent-attack-soldiers and attack-now.
+; - retires inherited Resonance/Fortress attack-state writers instead of merely overriding them later in the rule pass.
+; - real ally rescue commits about 40 percent of the existing field army toward enemies near allies for a timed intervention.
+; - rescue can override local DEFENSE/RECOVERY while one local defend group is deliberately retained.
+; - ally requests plus severe allied TC/villager/military collapse can trigger rescue; the force is released when the rescue window ends.
+; - four minutes of calm STABLE/ASSAULT economy arms a pressure window so a healthy Fortress cannot remain passive forever.
+; - ASSAULT entry emits one attack pulse; STABLE peace-pressure emits a controlled attack pulse; no legacy attack-now remains active.
+; - a compact four-slot elite guarantee rotates Champion / Arbalest / Paladin / Siege Onager without replacing the middle-tier backbone.
+; - Economy Governor remains the FIX21 design; only soft ASSAULT reserve thresholds and Feudal GROWTH food bias are gently tuned.
+; - no resource creation, no new wall/formations/civ systems, and no new executable vocabulary beyond FIX21 parser-proven tokens.
 ; FIX21 Fortress Economy 2.0 / economy-governed tier quality:
 ; - adds a five-state no-cheat Economy Governor: GROWTH, STABLE, DEFENSE, RECOVERY, ASSAULT.
 ; - economy state, not short military-population fluctuations, now owns df15-tier-posture.
